\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 I want to formally change how Business Hero is being developed.\
Until now, I have effectively been acting as the human API between Claude conversations, Claude Code, Fable, Codex, the test harness and debugging feedback. This is too slow and causes context loss, duplicated reasoning and regressions.\
I want us to establish a repository-centred, multi-agent engineering workflow in which Claude Code and Codex can independently build, test, review and debug Business Hero under the same documented rules. Fable can assist with product/UX design and visual review where appropriate. I remain the product owner and domain expert, but I should no longer have to decide which file to edit or manually relay routine technical information between agents.\
BUSINESS AND PRODUCT CONTEXT\
