\cf0 The initial commercial wedge should now be UK contractors and trade businesses.\
The proposition is not that Business Hero awards, guarantees or replaces CHAS, CAS or SSIP certification. It helps businesses operate their management systems consistently and produce evidence that their documented procedures are being followed.\
The core commercial message is:\
\'93Win the work, run the work, manage the money and prove compliance\'97all within one connected system, with one login and one subscription.\'94\
The compliance workflow should eventually connect:\
Job \uc0\u8594  operative \u8594  competence \u8594  RAMS \u8594  induction \u8594  PPE/equipment checks \u8594  site evidence \u8594  incidents/near misses \u8594  quality checks \u8594  supervisor sign-off \u8594  audit/evidence pack.\
MSC will be customer zero and the internal production case study. We then intend to recruit approximately ten UK contractor design partners.\
The immediate goal is a secure, stable and commercially testable RC1\'97not the completion of every imaginable Business Hero feature.\
